Package: adguard-gui
Version: 0.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
 python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
 python3-pyside6.qtsvg
Recommends: python3-pyside6.qtcore,
 python3-pyside6.qtgui
Suggests: adguardvpn-cli
Maintainer: AdGuard VPN GUI <noreply@example.com>
Description: AdGuard VPN desktop client (GUI)
 Modern Qt-based GUI on top of adguardvpn-cli with location list,
 kill-switch, autostart and multi-language support.
 .
 The adguardvpn-cli binary itself is distributed by AdGuard
 separately (https://adguard-vpn-cli.adtidy.org) and is not a Debian
 package, so apt cannot install it as a dependency.
